#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:3
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_WantToMakePokeblocks"
msgid ""
"Oh? Did you want to make some {POKEBLOCK}S\n"
"with this old-timer?$"
msgstr ""
"哦？你想和我这个老头子\n"
"一起做宝可方块吗？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:7
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_Excellent"
msgid "Excellent!$"
msgstr "太好了！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:10
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_MadeOldTimerSad"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"You've made this old-timer sad…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"你让我这个老头子好伤心……$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:14
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_KnowHowToMakePokeblocks"
msgid "Do you know how to make a {POKEBLOCK}?$"
msgstr "你知道怎么做宝可方块吗？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:17
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_LetsBerryBlender"
msgid ""
"Let's get started, then!\p"
"Let's BERRY BLENDER!$"
msgstr ""
"那我们开始吧！\p"
"来混合树果吧！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:21
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_ExplainBerryBlending"
msgid ""
"Okay, a little explanation, then.\p"
"Oh, don't worry, it's quite simple.\p"
"When the BLENDER's arrow comes to\n"
"your marker, just press the A Button.\p"
"That's all you have to do.\n"
"You'll see how easy it is when you try.$"
msgstr ""
"好，那我稍微说明一下。\p"
"哦，别担心，很简单的。\p"
"当混合器的箭头转到\n"
"你的标记时，按下A键就行了。\p"
"你要做的就只有这些。\n"
"试一下就知道有多简单了。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:29
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerries"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"You don't have any BERRIES?\p"
"If you don't have any BERRIES,\n"
"you can't make any {POKEBLOCK}S.$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你一颗树果都没有吗？\p"
"没有树果的话，\n"
"就做不了宝可方块了。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:35
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_CanHaveOneOfMyBerries"
msgid ""
"Well, that won't do at all now, will it?\p"
"If you don't mind leftovers, you can\n"
"have one of my BERRIES.\p"
"That way, we could make some {POKEBLOCK}S\n"
"together using the BERRY BLENDER.$"
msgstr ""
"那可不行啊。\p"
"如果你不介意是剩下的，\n"
"我可以给你一颗我的树果。\p"
"这样我们就能用树果混合器\n"
"一起做宝可方块了。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:42
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerriesToSpare"
msgid ""
"If I had some BERRIES left over,\n"
"I'd gladly give you one…\p"
"But, I don't have any to spare today.\n"
"We'll have to do this another time.$"
msgstr ""
"如果我有多余的树果，\n"
"很乐意给你一颗……\p"
"可是我今天没有多余的了。\n"
"只能下次再做了。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:48
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_PokeblockCaseIsFull"
msgid ""
"But your {POKEBLOCK} CASE is full.\p"
"You should use some {POKEBLOCK}S before\n"
"you come see me again.$"
msgstr ""
"可是你的宝可方块盒已经满了。\p"
"你应该先用掉一些宝可方块，\n"
"再来找我。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:53
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHavePokeblockCase"
msgid ""
"But you don't have a {POKEBLOCK} CASE.\p"
"You should get a {POKEBLOCK} CASE and then\n"
"come see me.$"
msgstr ""
"可是你没有宝可方块盒。\p"
"你应该先拿到宝可方块盒，\n"
"再来找我。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:58
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_LetsGetBlendingAlready"
msgid "Let's get blending already!$"
msgstr "快点开始混合吧！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:61
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_WhatKindOfPokeblockWillIGet"
msgid ""
"I wonder what kind of {POKEBLOCK} I'll get?\n"
"This is so exciting!$"
msgstr ""
"不知道会做出什么样的宝可方块呢？\n"
"真让人激动！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:65
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_WantToBlendPokeblocksWithUs"
msgid ""
"Hi, there! Did you want to blend some\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}S with us?$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！你想和我们\n"
"一起做宝可方块吗？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:69
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_Okay"
msgid "Okay!$"
msgstr "好的！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:72
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_ThatsTooBad"
msgid ""
"That's too bad…\p"
"But we'll always be around whenever\n"
"you get the urge to blend!$"
msgstr ""
"真遗憾……\p"
"不过只要你想混合树果，\n"
"随时都可以来找我们！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:77
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_KnowHowToMakePokeblocks2"
msgid ""
"Of course, you do know how to\n"
"blend {POKEBLOCK}S, don't you?$"
msgstr ""
"你当然知道\n"
"怎么做宝可方块吧？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:81
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_LetsBerryBlender2"
msgid ""
"Let's get started, then!\p"
"Let's BERRY BLENDER!$"
msgstr ""
"那我们开始吧！\p"
"来混合树果吧！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:85
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_ExplainBerryBlending2"
msgid ""
"Okay!\n"
"Let me explain it to you!\p"
"When the spinning BLENDER's arrow\n"
"reaches your marker, just press\l"
"the A Button.\p"
"That's all it takes.\n"
"Pretty easy, don't you think?$"
msgstr ""
"好！\n"
"我来给你说明一下！\p"
"当旋转的混合器的箭头\n"
"转到你的标记时，\l"
"按下A键就行了。\p"
"就这么简单。\n"
"很容易吧？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:94
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerries2"
msgid ""
"Oh, but wait a second here…\n"
"You don't have any BERRIES.\p"
"You can't make any {POKEBLOCK}S without\n"
"BERRIES…\p"
"We'll always be around whenever you\n"
"get hold of some BERRIES to blend.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，等一下……\n"
"你没有树果啊。\p"
"没有树果的话，\n"
"就做不了宝可方块……\p"
"等你有了可以混合的树果，\n"
"随时都可以来找我们。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:102
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_PokeblockCaseIsFull2"
msgid ""
"Oh, but wait a second here…\n"
"Your {POKEBLOCK} CASE is full.\p"
"You should use some {POKEBLOCK}S and\n"
"then come back.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，等一下……\n"
"你的宝可方块盒已经满了。\p"
"你应该先用掉一些宝可方块，\n"
"然后再来。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:108
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHavePokeblockCase2"
msgid ""
"Oh, but wait a second here…\n"
"You don't have a {POKEBLOCK} CASE.\p"
"You should get a {POKEBLOCK} CASE and\n"
"then come back.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，等一下……\n"
"你没有宝可方块盒。\p"
"你应该先拿到宝可方块盒，\n"
"然后再来。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:115
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_MakePokeblocksWithOurGroup"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello! Did you want to make some\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}S with our little group?$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你好！你想和我们\n"
"一起做宝可方块吗？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:119
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_OhDear"
msgid "Oh, dear!$"
msgstr "哎呀呀！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:122
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_LeftUsInShock"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear me…\p"
"You've left us in shock!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀……\p"
"真是吓了我们一跳！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:126
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_KnowHowToMakePokeblocks3"
msgid ""
"Naturally, you know how to make\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}S, don't you?$"
msgstr ""
"你当然知道\n"
"怎么做宝可方块吧？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:130
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_LetsBerryBlender3"
msgid ""
"Okay, dear!\n"
"Let's get started!\p"
"Let's BERRY BLENDER!$"
msgstr ""
"好的，亲爱的！\n"
"我们开始吧！\p"
"来混合树果吧！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:135
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_ExplainBerryBlending3"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear!\p"
"Then, I'll explain it to you nicely.\p"
"When the BLENDER's arrow spins to\n"
"your marker, press the A Button.\p"
"That's all it takes.\n"
"Isn't it simple?$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀！\p"
"那我就好好给你说明一下吧。\p"
"当混合器的箭头转到\n"
"你的标记时，按下A键。\p"
"就这么简单。\n"
"很简单吧？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:143
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerries3"
msgid ""
"You don't have any BERRIES,\n"
"do you?\p"
"If you don't have any BERRIES,\n"
"you can't make any {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"We'll always be making {POKEBLOCK}S here,\n"
"so let's make some together when\l"
"you get a BERRY or two.$"
msgstr ""
"你没有树果，\n"
"对吧？\p"
"没有树果的话，\n"
"就做不了宝可方块。\p"
"我们一直都在这里做宝可方块，\n"
"等你有了一两颗树果，\l"
"再一起来做吧。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:152
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_PokeblockCaseIsFull3"
msgid ""
"Your {POKEBLOCK} CASE is full,\n"
"it looks like.\p"
"You should use some {POKEBLOCK}S up\n"
"and then come back.$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可方块盒\n"
"好像已经满了。\p"
"你应该先用掉一些宝可方块，\n"
"然后再来。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:158
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHavePokeblockCase3"
msgid ""
"You haven't gotten a {POKEBLOCK} CASE\n"
"yet, it looks like.\p"
"You need to get a {POKEBLOCK} CASE before\n"
"you come back.$"
msgstr ""
"你好像还没有\n"
"宝可方块盒。\p"
"你需要先拿到宝可方块盒，\n"
"然后再来。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:164
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_SetNewBlenderRecord"
msgid ""
"Okay! Today's going to be the day that\n"
"I set a new BLENDER speed record!$"
msgstr ""
"好！今天我一定要\n"
"刷新混合器的速度纪录！$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:168
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_LookGoodAtBlendingJoinUs"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear!\n"
"You look as if you're good at blending.\l"
"Would you like to join us?$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀！\n"
"你看起来很擅长混合树果。\l"
"要和我们一起来吗？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:173
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_MakeDeliciousPokeblocks"
msgid ""
"I'm going to make delicious {POKEBLOCK}S\n"
"and make my POKéMON cuter.$"
msgstr ""
"我要做出美味的宝可方块，\n"
"让我的宝可梦变得更可爱。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:177
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_SaveGameBeforeBerryBlenderLink"
msgid ""
"{POKEBLOCK}S will be made with your friends \n"
"from BERRIES in the BERRY BLENDER.\p"
"Is it okay to save the game before\n"
"linking with your friends?$"
msgstr ""
"将和朋友们一起，用树果混合器\n"
"把树果做成宝可方块。\p"
"在和朋友连接之前，\n"
"可以先记录游戏进度吗？$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:183
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_SearchingForFriends"
msgid ""
"Searching for your friends…\n"
"… … B Button: Cancel$"
msgstr ""
"正在寻找你的朋友……\n"
"…… ……B键：取消$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:187
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_Player1Arrived"
msgid "{STR_VAR_1} arrived.$"
msgstr "{STR_VAR_1}来了。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:190
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_Player1And2Arrived"
msgid "{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2} arrived.$"
msgstr "{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}来了。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:193
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_AllPlayersArrived"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_2}, and\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} arrived.$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}、{STR_VAR_2}和\n"
"{STR_VAR_3}来了。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:197
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_NoBerriesLink"
msgid ""
"You have no BERRIES.\n"
"The BERRY BLENDER can't be used.$"
msgstr ""
"你没有树果。\n"
"无法使用树果混合器。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:201
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_PokeblockCaseIsFullLink"
msgid ""
"Your {POKEBLOCK} CASE is full.\n"
"The BERRY BLENDER can't be used.$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可方块盒已经满了。\n"
"无法使用树果混合器。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:205
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHavePokeblockCaseLink"
msgid ""
"You don't have a {POKEBLOCK} CASE.\n"
"The BERRY BLENDER can't be used.$"
msgstr ""
"你没有宝可方块盒。\n"
"无法使用树果混合器。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:209
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_LoveMakingPokeblocks"
msgid ""
"I love making {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"I always have some BERRIES with me.$"
msgstr ""
"我最喜欢做宝可方块了。\p"
"我身上总是带着一些树果。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:213
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_MakePokeblocksUsingBerryBlender"
msgid ""
"If you'd like, we could make some\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}S together using the\l"
"BERRY BLENDER.$"
msgstr ""
"如果你愿意的话，我们可以\n"
"用树果混合器\l"
"一起做宝可方块。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:218
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerriesHaveOne"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"You don't have any BERRIES?\p"
"Well, that won't do at all now, will it?\p"
"If you don't mind leftovers, you can\n"
"have one of my BERRIES.$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你一颗树果都没有吗？\p"
"那可不行啊。\p"
"如果你不介意是剩下的，\n"
"我可以给你一颗我的树果。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:225
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_UseItToMakePokeblocksTogether"
msgid ""
"We'll use it to make {POKEBLOCK}S together\n"
"using the BERRY BLENDER.$"
msgstr ""
"我们就用它和树果混合器\n"
"一起做宝可方块吧。$"

#: data/scripts/berry_blender.inc:229
msgctxt "BerryBlender_Text_DontHaveAnyBerriesNoneToSpare"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"You don't have any BERRIES?\p"
"If I had some left over, I'd gladly\n"
"give you one…\p"
"But, I don't have any to spare today.\n"
"Sorry about that.$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你一颗树果都没有吗？\p"
"如果我有多余的，\n"
"很乐意给你一颗……\p"
"可是我今天没有多余的了。\n"
"真抱歉。$"
